        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo imbizi zya-Farao, ankalaki zyakwe abasimbizi bakwe, nizyakanjila mulwizi, Jehova wakaboozya maanzi aalwizi alimbabo, pele bana ba-Israyeli bakeenda anyika injumu akati kalwizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
