        {
          "text": "Elyo Musa wakasungula ba-Israyeli kuzwa ku-Lwizi Lusalala, nkabela bakaya kunkanda ya-Suri, Lino bakeenda mazuba otatwe mu nkanda kabatajene maanzi, ",
