        {
          "text": "Basike buyo ku-Mata, bakakacilwa kunywa maanzi aaku-Mara, nkaambo akalula. Nciceeco oko kuntu ncikwakaulikilwa kuti ngu-Mara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
